### Operational Reminders

- Use `--values-json` for Google Sheets writes
- Preserve `APPKEY:{APP_KEY}` markers in sheet notes
- Candidate/employee-facing errors must stay plain and never expose tool or auth details
- Generated QR codes and exported PDFs may be written only to the outbound media folder

## Why Separate?

`SKILL.md` defines behavior. `TOOLS.md` keeps local values, targets, and paths in one place so the workflow can stay consistent without bloating the shared skill.

